{"version":1,"id":"matematicas-2004-septiembre","asignatura":"matematicas","anio":2004,"convocatoria":"Septiembre","documento":"MAT-2004-SEPTIEMBRE.pdf","ejercicios":[{"id":"matematicas-2004-septiembre-1","n":1,"num":1,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Se desea construir una caja cerrada de base cuadrada con una capacidad de \\(80\\ \\text{cm}^3\\). Para la tapa y la superficie lateral se usa un material que cuesta 1 €/cm² y para la base se emplea un material un 50 % más caro. Halla las dimensiones de la caja para que su coste sea mínimo.","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Sea \\(x\\) el lado de la base y \\(h\\) la altura (en cm). Volumen: \\(x^2h=80\\Rightarrow h=\\frac{80}{x^2}\\).</p><p>Coste: la tapa (\\(x^2\\)) y las 4 caras laterales (\\(4xh\\)) a 1 €/cm²; la base (\\(x^2\\)) a 1,5 €/cm²:</p>\\[C=x^2+4xh+1{,}5x^2=\\frac52x^2+\\frac{320}x,\\qquad x\\gt0\\]<p>Estudiamos el signo de \\(C'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>:</p>\\[C'(x)=5x-\\frac{320}{x^2}=\\frac{5x^3-320}{x^2}=0\\iff x^3=64\\iff\\boxed{x=4}\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 210 108' width='100%' style='max-width:252px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H196' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M14 56L18 48M18 56L22 48M22 56L26 48M26 56L30 48M30 56L34 48M34 56L38 48' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.1'/><path d='M40 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='40' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>0</text><path d='M114 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='114' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>4</text><text x='51.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M65.0 10L101.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M92.0 39L101.0 40L99.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='77.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>C</tspan>′(1) &lt; 0</text><text x='129.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M143.0 40L179.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M170.0 11L179.0 10L177.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='155.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>C</tspan>′(5) &gt; 0</text></svg></div><p>\\(C\\) decrece en \\((0,4)\\) debido a que \\(C'(x)\\lt0\\), y crece en \\((4,+\\infty)\\) debido a que \\(C'(x)\\gt0\\): en \\(x=4\\) hay un mínimo absoluto<i class='n' data-t='why'>Hay un mínimo donde \\(f\\) pasa de decrecer a crecer y un máximo donde pasa de crecer a decrecer.</i>. Entonces \\(h=\\frac{80}{16}=5\\).</p><div class='res'>Base cuadrada de 4 cm de lado y altura 5 cm (coste mínimo 120 €)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"opt","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2004-SEPTIEMBRE.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2004-septiembre-2","n":2,"num":2,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Siendo \\(\\ln x\\) el logaritmo neperiano de \\(x\\), halla el área de la superficie sombreada.<div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 170' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='50.2,47.0 52.5,47.0 54.8,47.0 57.0,47.0 59.3,47.0 61.6,47.0 63.8,47.0 66.1,47.0 68.4,47.0 70.6,47.0 72.9,47.0 75.2,47.0 77.4,47.0 79.7,47.0 82.0,47.0 84.2,47.0 86.5,47.0 88.8,47.0 91.0,47.0 93.3,47.0 95.6,47.0 97.8,47.0 100.1,47.0 102.4,47.0 104.7,47.0 106.9,47.0 109.2,47.0 111.5,47.0 113.7,47.0 116.0,47.0 118.3,47.0 120.5,47.0 122.8,47.0 125.1,47.0 127.3,47.0 129.6,47.0 131.9,47.0 134.1,47.0 136.4,47.0 138.7,47.0 140.9,47.0 143.2,47.0 145.5,47.0 147.7,47.0 150.0,47.0 152.3,47.0 154.5,47.0 156.8,47.0 159.1,47.0 161.3,47.0 163.6,47.0 165.9,47.0 168.1,47.0 170.4,47.0 172.7,47.0 174.9,47.0 177.2,47.0 179.5,47.0 181.7,47.0 184.0,47.0 186.3,47.0 188.5,47.0 190.8,47.0 193.1,47.0 195.3,47.0 197.6,47.0 199.9,47.0 202.2,47.0 204.4,47.0 206.7,47.0 209.0,47.0 211.2,47.0 213.5,47.0 215.8,47.0 218.0,47.0 220.3,47.0 222.6,47.0 224.8,47.0 227.1,47.0 229.4,47.0 231.6,47.0 231.6,47.0 229.4,47.5 227.1,48.1 224.8,48.7 222.6,49.3 220.3,49.9 218.0,50.5 215.8,51.1 213.5,51.7 211.2,52.3 209.0,52.9 206.7,53.6 204.4,54.2 202.2,54.9 199.9,55.6 197.6,56.3 195.3,57.0 193.1,57.7 190.8,58.4 188.5,59.1 186.3,59.9 184.0,60.6 181.7,61.4 179.5,62.2 177.2,62.9 174.9,63.8 172.7,64.6 170.4,65.4 168.1,66.3 165.9,67.1 163.6,68.0 161.3,68.9 159.1,69.9 156.8,70.8 154.5,71.8 152.3,72.8 150.0,73.8 147.7,74.8 145.5,75.8 143.2,76.9 140.9,78.0 138.7,79.2 136.4,80.3 134.1,81.5 131.9,82.8 129.6,84.0 127.3,85.3 125.1,86.7 122.8,88.0 120.5,89.5 118.3,90.9 116.0,92.4 113.7,94.0 111.5,95.7 109.2,96.2 106.9,96.2 104.7,96.2 102.4,96.2 100.1,96.2 97.8,96.2 95.6,96.2 93.3,96.2 91.0,96.2 88.8,96.2 86.5,96.2 84.2,96.2 82.0,96.2 79.7,96.2 77.4,96.2 75.2,96.2 72.9,96.2 70.6,96.2 68.4,96.2 66.1,96.2 63.8,96.2 61.6,96.2 59.3,96.2 57.0,96.2 54.8,96.2 52.5,96.2 50.2,96.2' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='71.4,143.3 73.9,138.3 76.3,133.9 78.8,129.9 81.2,126.2 83.7,122.8 86.1,119.6 88.6,116.6 91.0,113.8 93.5,111.2 96.0,108.7 98.4,106.4 100.9,104.2 103.3,102.0 105.8,100.0 108.2,98.1 110.7,96.2 113.2,94.4 115.6,92.7 118.1,91.1 120.5,89.5 123.0,87.9 125.4,86.4 127.9,85.0 130.3,83.6 132.8,82.2 135.3,80.9 137.7,79.6 140.2,78.4 142.6,77.2 145.1,76.0 147.5,74.9 150.0,73.8 152.5,72.7 154.9,71.6 157.4,70.6 159.8,69.5 162.3,68.6 164.7,67.6 167.2,66.6 169.7,65.7 172.1,64.8 174.6,63.9 177.0,63.0 179.5,62.2 181.9,61.3 184.4,60.5 186.8,59.7 189.3,58.9 191.8,58.1 194.2,57.3 196.7,56.6 199.1,55.8 201.6,55.1 204.0,54.4 206.5,53.6 209.0,52.9 211.4,52.3 213.9,51.6 216.3,50.9 218.8,50.3 221.2,49.6 223.7,49.0 226.1,48.3 228.6,47.7 231.1,47.1 233.5,46.5 236.0,45.9 238.4,45.3 240.9,44.7 243.3,44.2 245.8,43.6 248.3,43.0 250.7,42.5 253.2,41.9 255.6,41.4 258.1,40.9 260.5,40.3 263.0,39.8 265.5,39.3 267.9,38.8' fill='none' stroke='#334155' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='231.6' y1='96.2' x2='231.6' y2='47.0' stroke='#94a3b8' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-dasharray='5 4'/><text x='231.6' y='31.2' fill='#334155' font-size='10'>y = ln x</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 96.2H294.0M50.2 164.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='110.7' y1='93.2' x2='110.7' y2='99.2' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='107.7' y='110.2' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='231.6' y1='93.2' x2='231.6' y2='99.2' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='228.6' y='110.2' font-size='10'>3</text></svg></div>","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p>La región está limitada por el eje \\(OY\\), el eje \\(OX\\), la recta \\(y=\\ln3\\) (la altura de la curva en \\(x=3\\)) y la gráfica de \\(\\ln x\\). De 0 a 1 es un rectángulo de altura \\(\\ln3\\); de 1 a 3 queda entre \\(y=\\ln3\\) e \\(y=\\ln x\\). En total:</p>\\[A=3\\ln3-\\int_1^3\\ln x\\,dx\\]<p>Por partes<i class='n' data-t='th'>Integración por partes: \\(\\int u\\,dv=uv-\\int v\\,du\\).</i> con \\(u=\\ln x\\), \\(dv=dx\\): \\(\\int\\ln x\\,dx=x\\ln x-x\\).</p>\\[\\int_1^3\\ln x\\,dx=\\bigl[x\\ln x-x\\bigr]_1^3=(3\\ln3-3)-(0-1)=3\\ln3-2\\]\\[A=3\\ln3-(3\\ln3-2)=2\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=2\\ u^2\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Integrando respecto de \\(y\\) sale directo: \\(\\int_0^{\\ln3}e^y\\,dy=3-1=2\\).</i></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"integ","tipo":"area","apartados":""},{"tema":"integ","tipo":"part","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2004-SEPTIEMBRE.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2004-septiembre-3","n":3,"num":3,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Determina \\(a\\) y \\(b\\) sabiendo que el sistema de ecuaciones \\[\\begin{cases}x+3y+z=1\\\\-x+y+2z=-1\\\\ax+by+z=4\\end{cases}\\] tiene al menos dos soluciones distintas.","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Si un sistema lineal tiene dos soluciones distintas, tiene infinitas: debe ser compatible indeterminado, \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*\\lt3\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Rouché-Frobenius: el sistema es compatible si y solo si \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*\\); determinado si ese rango es el número de incógnitas, indeterminado si es menor.</i>.</p>\\[A^*=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1&3&1&1\\\\-1&1&2&-1\\\\a&b&1&4\\end{array}\\right),\\qquad\\begin{vmatrix}1&3\\\\-1&1\\end{vmatrix}=4\\neq0\\]<p>El rango es al menos 2. Para que sea 2 tienen que anularse los dos menores que orlan ese menor: el de la 3.ª columna (\\(|A|\\)) y el de la de términos independientes. Por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&3&1\\\\-1&1&2\\\\a&b&1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(1+6 a- b\\bigr)-\\bigl(a+2 b-3\\bigr)\\]\\[=5a-3b+4\\]\\[\\begin{vmatrix}1&3&1\\\\-1&1&-1\\\\a&b&4\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(4- 3 a- b\\bigr)-\\bigl(a- b-12\\bigr)\\]\\[=16-4a\\]\\[16-4a=0\\iff a=4;\\qquad5\\cdot4-3b+4=0\\iff b=8\\]<div class='res'>\\(a=4\\), \\(b=8\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"sistemas","tipo":"disc","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2004-SEPTIEMBRE.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2004-septiembre-4","n":4,"num":4,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Se sabe que el triángulo \\(ABC\\) es rectángulo en el vértice \\(C\\), que pertenece a la recta intersección de los planos \\(y+z=1\\) e \\(y-3z+3=0\\), y que sus otros dos vértices son \\(A(2,0,1)\\) y \\(B(0,-3,0)\\). Halla \\(C\\) y el área del triángulo \\(ABC\\).","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Recta intersección: restando las ecuaciones, \\(4z=4\\Rightarrow z=1\\), y entonces \\(y=0\\); \\(x\\) es libre: \\(r\\equiv(t,\\,0,\\,1)\\). Así \\(C(t,0,1)\\).</p><p>El ángulo en \\(C\\) es recto: \\(\\overrightarrow{CA}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{CB}=0\\).</p>\\[\\overrightarrow{CA}=(2-t,0,0),\\quad\\overrightarrow{CB}=(-t,-3,-1),\\quad\\overrightarrow{CA}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{CB}=-t(2-t)=0\\iff t=0\\ \\text{ o }\\ t=2\\]<p>Con \\(t=2\\) sería \\(C=(2,0,1)=A\\) y no habría triángulo. Luego \\(C(0,0,1)\\).</p>\\[\\text{Área}=\\frac{|\\overrightarrow{CA}|\\,|\\overrightarrow{CB}|}2=\\frac{2\\cdot\\sqrt{10}}2=\\sqrt{10}\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":-81,\"el\":68,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[2,0,1],[0,-3,0],[0,0,1]],\"#f59e0b\",\"#b45309\"],[\"line\",[0.35,0.0,1.0],[0.35,-0.332,0.889],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[0.35,-0.332,0.889],[0.0,-0.332,0.889],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[-1.0,0.0,1.0],[3.0,0.0,1.0],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[3.0,0.0,1.0],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"pt\",[2,0,1],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0,-3,0],\"B\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0,0,1],\"C\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m04sa4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m04sa4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m04sa4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m04sa4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='232.8,48.4 62.2,246.0 94.9,28.1' fill='#f59e0b' fill-opacity='.26' stroke=