,"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2004-septiembre-5","n":5,"num":1,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"De una función \\(f:[0,4]\\to\\mathbb R\\) se sabe que \\(f(1)=3\\) y que la gráfica de su función derivada es la que aparece en el dibujo.<div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 130' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polyline points='41.2,93.1 42.6,91.7 43.9,90.3 45.2,88.9 46.5,87.5 47.9,86.1 49.2,84.7 50.5,83.3 51.8,81.9 53.2,80.5 54.5,79.1 55.8,77.7 57.1,76.2 58.5,74.8 59.8,73.4 61.1,72.0 62.4,70.6 63.8,69.2 65.1,67.8 66.4,66.4 67.8,65.0 69.1,63.6 70.4,62.2 71.7,60.8 73.1,59.4 74.4,58.0 75.7,56.6 77.0,55.2 78.4,53.8 79.7,52.3 81.0,50.9 82.3,49.5 83.7,48.1 85.0,46.7 86.3,45.3 87.7,43.9 89.0,42.5 90.3,41.1 91.6,39.7 93.0,38.3 94.3,36.9 95.6,37.6 96.9,38.3 98.3,39.0 99.6,39.7 100.9,40.4 102.2,41.1 103.6,41.8 104.9,42.5 106.2,43.2 107.6,43.9 108.9,44.6 110.2,45.3 111.5,46.0 112.9,46.7 114.2,47.4 115.5,48.1 116.8,48.8 118.2,49.5 119.5,50.2 120.8,50.9 122.1,51.6 123.5,52.3 124.8,53.0 126.1,53.8 127.4,54.5 128.8,55.2 130.1,55.9 131.4,56.6 132.8,57.3 134.1,58.0 135.4,58.7 136.7,59.4 138.1,60.1 139.4,60.8 140.7,61.5 142.0,62.2 143.4,62.9 144.7,63.6 146.0,64.3 147.3,65.0 148.7,65.7 150.0,66.4 151.3,67.1 152.7,67.8 154.0,68.5 155.3,69.2 156.6,69.9 158.0,70.6 159.3,71.3 160.6,72.0 161.9,72.7 163.3,73.4 164.6,74.1 165.9,74.8 167.2,75.5 168.6,76.2 169.9,77.0 171.2,77.7 172.6,78.4 173.9,79.1 175.2,79.8 176.5,80.5 177.9,81.2 179.2,81.9 180.5,82.6 181.8,83.3 183.2,84.0 184.5,84.7 185.8,85.4 187.1,86.1 188.5,86.8 189.8,87.5 191.1,88.2 192.4,88.9 193.8,89.6 195.1,90.3 196.4,91.0 197.8,91.7 199.1,92.4 200.4,93.1 201.7,93.1 203.1,93.0 204.4,92.8 205.7,92.6 207.0,92.2 208.4,91.9 209.7,91.4 211.0,90.9 212.3,90.3 213.7,89.6 215.0,88.9 216.3,88.1 217.7,87.2 219.0,86.2 220.3,85.2 221.6,84.1 223.0,83.0 224.3,81.7 225.6,80.4 226.9,79.1 228.3,77.6 229.6,76.1 230.9,74.5 232.2,72.9 233.6,71.2 234.9,69.4 236.2,67.5 237.6,65.6 238.9,63.6 240.2,61.5 241.5,59.3 242.9,57.1 244.2,54.8 245.5,52.5 246.8,50.1 248.2,47.6 249.5,45.0 250.8,42.4 252.1,39.7 253.5,36.9' fill='none' stroke='#334155' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='94.3' y1='93.1' x2='94.3' y2='36.9' stroke='#94a3b8' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-dasharray='5 4'/><line x1='253.5' y1='93.1' x2='253.5' y2='36.9' stroke='#94a3b8' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-dasharray='5 4'/><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 93.1H294.0M41.2 124.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='94.3' y1='90.1' x2='94.3' y2='96.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='91.3' y='107.1' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='147.3' y1='90.1' x2='147.3' y2='96.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='144.3' y='107.1' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='200.4' y1='90.1' x2='200.4' y2='96.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='197.4' y='107.1' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='253.5' y1='90.1' x2='253.5' y2='96.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='250.5' y='107.1' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='38.2' y1='36.9' x2='44.2' y2='36.9' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='25.2' y='40.9' font-size='10'>1</text></svg></div>","apartados":["(0,5 p.) Halla la recta tangente a la gráfica de \\(f\\) en el punto de abscisa \\(x=1\\).","(1 p.) Determina los intervalos de crecimiento y de decrecimiento de \\(f\\). ¿En qué punto alcanza la función \\(f\\) su máximo absoluto?","(1 p.) Estudia la concavidad y la convexidad de \\(f\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>En la gráfica, \\(f'(1)=1\\), y \\(f(1)=3\\):</p><div class='res'>\\(y-3=1\\cdot(x-1)\\iff y=x+2\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>En el dibujo \\(f'(x)\\geq0\\) en \\([0,4]\\) y solo se anula en los puntos aislados \\(x=0\\) y \\(x=3\\):</p><div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 228 108' width='100%' style='max-width:274px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H214' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M14 56L18 48M18 56L22 48M22 56L26 48M26 56L30 48M30 56L34 48M34 56L38 48' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.1'/><path d='M190 56L194 48M194 56L198 48M198 56L202 48M202 56L206 48M206 56L210 48M210 56L214 48' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.1'/><path d='M40 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='40' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>0</text><path d='M114 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='114' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>3</text><path d='M188 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='188' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>4</text><text x='51.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M65.0 40L101.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M92.0 11L101.0 10L99.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='77.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(1) &gt; 0</text><text x='125.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M139.0 40L175.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M166.0 11L175.0 10L173.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='151.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(3,5) &gt; 0</text></svg></div><p>\\(f\\) crece en \\((0,3)\\) y en \\((3,4)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\gt0\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si \\(f'\\gt0\\) en un intervalo, \\(f\\) crece en él; si \\(f'\\lt0\\), decrece.</i>; como es continua, crece en todo \\([0,4]\\) (en \\(x=3\\) tiene tangente horizontal pero no hay extremo).</p><div class='res'>\\(f\\) es creciente en \\([0,4]\\); alcanza su máximo absoluto en \\(x=4\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado c","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(f\\) es convexa donde \\(f'\\) crece y cóncava donde \\(f'\\) decrece<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si \\(f'\\) es creciente en un intervalo, \\(f''\\geq0\\) y \\(f\\) es convexa; si \\(f'\\) es decreciente, \\(f\\) es cóncava.</i>. En el dibujo, \\(f'\\) crece en \\((0,1)\\), decrece en \\((1,3)\\) y crece en \\((3,4)\\).</p><div class='res'>Convexa en \\((0,1)\\) y en \\((3,4)\\); cóncava en \\((1,3)\\). Hay puntos de inflexión en \\(x=1\\) y \\(x=3\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"tang","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"mono","apartados":"b"},{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"curv","apartados":"c"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2004-SEPTIEMBRE.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2004-septiembre-6","n":6,"num":2,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Calcula el área del recinto acotado que está limitado por la recta \\(y=2x\\) y por las curvas \\(y=x^2\\) e \\(y=\\dfrac{x^2}2\\).","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Cortes: \\(x^2=2x\\Rightarrow x=0,2\\); \\(\\frac{x^2}2=2x\\Rightarrow x=0,4\\); \\(x^2=\\frac{x^2}2\\Rightarrow x=0\\).</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 220' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='48.9,185.3 51.3,185.3 53.7,185.1 56.1,184.9 58.5,184.6 60.9,184.2 63.3,183.7 65.7,183.1 68.1,182.4 70.6,181.6 73.0,180.7 75.4,179.8 77.8,178.7 80.2,177.5 82.6,176.3 85.0,175.0 87.4,173.6 89.8,172.0 92.2,170.4 94.6,168.7 97.0,166.9 99.4,165.1 101.9,163.1 104.3,161.0 106.7,158.9 109.1,156.6 111.5,154.3 113.9,151.8 116.3,149.3 118.7,146.7 121.1,144.0 123.5,141.2 125.9,138.3 128.3,135.3 130.7,132.2 133.1,129.1 135.6,125.8 138.0,122.4 140.4,119.0 142.8,115.5 145.2,111.8 147.6,110.0 150.0,108.2 152.4,106.3 154.8,104.5 157.2,102.7 159.6,100.8 162.0,99.0 164.4,97.1 166.9,95.3 169.3,93.5 171.7,91.6 174.1,89.8 176.5,88.0 178.9,86.1 181.3,84.3 183.7,82.4 186.1,8