0,182.0 23.9,182.8 27.9,183.6 31.8,184.1 35.7,184.6 39.7,185.0 43.6,185.2 47.5,185.3 51.5,185.3 55.4,185.1 59.3,184.9 63.3,184.5 67.2,184.0 71.1,183.3 75.0,182.6 79.0,181.7 82.9,180.7 86.8,179.6 90.8,178.4 94.7,177.0 98.6,175.5 102.6,173.9 106.5,172.2 110.4,170.3 114.4,168.3 118.3,166.2 122.2,164.0 126.2,161.6 130.1,159.2 134.0,156.6 138.0,153.9 141.9,151.0 145.8,148.1 149.8,145.0 153.7,141.8 157.6,138.5 161.6,135.0 165.5,131.4 169.4,127.8 173.4,123.9 177.3,120.0 181.2,115.9 185.1,111.8 189.1,107.4 193.0,103.0 196.9,98.5 200.9,93.8 204.8,89.0 208.7,84.1 212.7,79.0 216.6,73.9 220.5,68.6 224.5,63.2 228.4,57.6 232.3,52.0 236.3,46.2 240.2,40.3 244.1,34.3 248.1,28.2 252.0,21.9 255.9,15.5' fill='none' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='34.4,196.3 147.6,110.0 260.7,23.7' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='145.2' cy='111.8' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='105.2' y='107.8'>(2,4)</text><circle cx='241.5' cy='38.4' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='249.5' y='52.4'>(4,8)</text><text x='121.1' y='65.9' fill='#2f6df0' font-size='10'>y=x²</text><text x='251.1' y='64.1' fill='#16a34a' font-size='10'>y=x²/2</text><text x='193.3' y='51.2' fill='#f0a30a' font-size='10'>y=2x</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 185.3H294.0M48.9 214.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='97.0' y1='182.3' x2='97.0' y2='188.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='94.0' y='199.3' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='145.2' y1='182.3' x2='145.2' y2='188.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='142.2' y='199.3' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='193.3' y1='182.3' x2='193.3' y2='188.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='190.3' y='199.3' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='241.5' y1='182.3' x2='241.5' y2='188.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='238.5' y='199.3' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='45.9' y1='148.6' x2='51.9' y2='148.6' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='32.9' y='152.6' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='45.9' y1='111.8' x2='51.9' y2='111.8' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='32.9' y='115.8' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='45.9' y1='75.1' x2='51.9' y2='75.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='32.9' y='79.1' font-size='10'>6</text><line x1='45.9' y1='38.4' x2='51.9' y2='38.4' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='32.9' y='42.4' font-size='10'>8</text></svg></div><p>Por debajo siempre está \\(y=\\frac{x^2}2\\). Por arriba, \\(y=x^2\\) entre 0 y 2, e \\(y=2x\\) entre 2 y 4:</p>\\[A=\\int_0^2\\left(x^2-\\frac{x^2}2\\right)dx+\\int_2^4\\left(2x-\\frac{x^2}2\\right)dx=\\Bigl[\\frac{x^3}6\\Bigr]_0^2+\\Bigl[x^2-\\frac{x^3}6\\Bigr]_2^4=\\frac43+\\left(\\frac{16}3-\\frac83\\right)=4\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=4\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"integ","tipo":"area","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2004-SEPTIEMBRE.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2004-septiembre-7","n":7,"num":3,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"","apartados":["(1 p.) Sabiendo que la matriz \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}3&-2&1\\\\1&-4&-2\\\\-1&a-1&a\\end{pmatrix}\\) tiene rango 2, ¿cuál es el valor de \\(a\\)?","(1,5 p.) Resuelve el sistema de ecuaciones \\[\\begin{pmatrix}3&-2&1\\\\1&-4&-2\\\\-1&-6&-5\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}\\]"]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(\\begin{vmatrix}3&-2\\\\1&-4\\end{vmatrix}=-10\\neq0\\), así que el rango es al menos 2; es 2 si y solo si \\(|A|=0\\). Por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}3&-2&1\\\\1&-4&-2\\\\-1&a-1&a\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(- 12 a-4+a - 1\\bigr)-\\bigl(4+6 - 6 a- 2 a\\bigr)\\]\\[=-3a-15\\]<div class='res'>\\(a=-5\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>La matriz de coeficientes es la de a) con \\(a=-5\\): rango 2. Menor de \\(A^*\\) de las columnas 1, 2 y 4:</p>\\[\\begin{vmatrix}3&-2&1\\\\1&-4&0\\\\-1&-6&-1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(12+0-6\\bigr)-\\bigl(4+0+2\\bigr)\\]\\[=0\\]<p>\\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*=2\\): compatible indeterminado<i class='n' data-t='th'>Rouché-Frobenius: el sistema es compatible si y solo si \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*\\); determinado si ese rango es el número de incógnitas, indeterminado si es menor.</i>. Uso las dos primeras ecuaciones con \\(z=t\\): \\(3x-2y=1-t\\), \\(x-4y=2t\\). </p><p>Lo resuelvo por la regla de Cramer<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Cramer: si \\(|A|\\neq0\\), cada incógnita es el cociente entre el determinante que resulta de sustituir su columna por la de los términos independientes y el determinante \\(|A|\\) de la matriz de coeficientes.</i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}3&-2\\\\1&-4\\end{vmatrix}=-10\\]\\[x=\\frac{\\begin{vmatrix}1 - t&-2\\\\2 t&-4\\end{vmatrix}}{-10}=\\frac{4 (2 t - 1)}{-10}=\\frac{2}{5} - \\frac{4 t}{5}\\]\\[y=\\frac{\\begin{vmatrix}3&1 - t\\\\1&2 t\\end{vmatrix}}{-10}=\\frac{7 t - 1}{-10}=\\frac{1}{10} - \\frac{7 t}{10}\\]<div class='res'>\\(x=\\dfrac{2-4t}5,\\ y=\\dfrac{1-7t}{10},\\ z=t\\), con \\(t\\in\\mathbb R\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"matrices","tipo":"rango","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"sistemas","tipo":"res","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2004-SEPTIEMBRE.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2004-septiembre-8","n":8,"num":4,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Halla la perpendicular común a las rectas \\(r\\equiv\\begin{cases}x=1\\\\y=1\\\\z=\\alpha\\end{cases}\\) y \\(s\\equiv\\begin{cases}x=\\beta\\\\y=\\beta-1\\\\z=-1\\end{cases}\\)","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(r\\) tiene director \\(\\vec u=(0,0,1)\\) y \\(s\\) tiene director \\(\\vec v=(1,1,0)\\). Tomo un punto genérico de cada una y obligo a que el vector que los une sea perpendicular a las dos:</p>\\[P(1,\\,1,\\,\\alpha)\\in r,\\quad Q(\\beta,\\,\\beta-1,\\,-1)\\in s,\\quad\\overrightarrow{PQ}=(\\beta-1,\\ \\beta-2,\\ -1-\\alpha)\\]\\[\\begin{cases}\\overrightarrow{PQ}\\cdot\\vec u=0\\\\\\overrightarrow{PQ}\\cdot\\vec v=0\\end{cases}\\iff\\begin{cases}-1-\\alpha=0\\\\2\\beta-3=0\\end{cases}\\iff\\alpha=-1,\\ \\beta=\\frac32\\]<p>\\(P(1,1,-1)\\), \\(Q\\left(\\frac32,\\frac12,-1\\right)\\) y \\(\\overrightarrow{PQ}=\\left(\\frac12,-\\frac12,0\\right)\\parallel(1,-1,0)\\).</p><div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":0,\"el\":34,\"p\":[[\"line\",[1.0,1.0,-3.2],[1.0,1.0,0.2],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[1.0,1.0,0.2],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[-0.4,-1.4,-1.0],[2.6,1.6,-1.0],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[2.6,1.6,-1.0],\"s\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[0.0,2.0,-1.0],[2.5,-0.5,-1.0],\"#e11d48\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[2.5,-0.5,-1.0],\"p\",\"#e11d48\",6,0],[\"pt\",[1,1,-1],\"P\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[1.5,0.5,-1],\"Q\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"recta\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m04sb4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m04sb4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m04sb4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m04sb4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><line x1='220.1' y1='246.0' x2='220.1' y2='18.0' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='226.1' y='18.0' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='26.0' y1='35.1' x2='268.7' y2='170.8' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='274.7' y='170.8' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>s</text><line x1='301.0' y1='53.2' x2='98.8' y2='166.3' stroke='#e11d48' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x=